.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6804367"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E7%94%B2%E6%BA%B4%E5%96%B9%E9%85%AE"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/%E7%94%B2%E6%BA%B4%E5%96%B9%E9%85%AE"}],"wikidata":"Q6804367","formula":"C15H11BrN2O","molarMass":315.16,"pharmacology":{"text":"Mebroqualone (MBQ) is a quinazolinone-class GABAergic and is an analogue of mecloqualone that has similar sedative and hypnotic properties to its parent compound, resulting from its agonist activity at the β subtype of the GABAa receptor.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Mebroqualone","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mebroqualone"},"uses":{"text":"It would appear that this compound was sold on the black market in Germany as a designer drug analogue of mecloqualone.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Mebroqualone","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mebroqualone"},"zh":"甲溴喹酮","zhHans":"甲溴喹酮","summaryZh":"甲溴喹酮（英語：Mebroqualone，簡稱MBQ）是一種喹唑啉酮類GABA能藥物，是甲氯喹酮的類似物，由於其對GABAA受體的β亞型具有激動劑活性，因此具有與其母體化合物相似的鎮靜和催眠特性。它最初是在1960年代合成的。甲溴喹酮與甲氯喹酮的不同之處在於其3-苯環上有一個溴原子而不是氯原子。","summaryZhHans":"甲溴喹酮（英语：Mebroqualone，简称MBQ）是一种喹唑啉酮类GABA能药物，是甲氯喹酮的类似物，由于其对GABAA受体的β亚型具有激动剂活性，因此具有与其母体化合物相似的镇静和催眠特性。它最初是在1960年代合成的。甲溴喹酮与甲氯喹酮的不同之处在于其3-苯环上有一个溴原子而不是氯原子。"}